### <%= member_heading(@method) %>

<%- if @method.constructor? -%>
*(Ruby's default constructor; documents `#initialize`.)*

<%- end -%>
<%- overloads = @method.tags(:overload) -%>
<%- if overloads.size >= 2 -%>
<%- if private_api_annotation(@method) -%>
**<%= private_api_annotation(@method) %>**

<%- end -%>
<%= markdownify(@method.docstring) %>
<%- overloads.each do |ov| -%>

```ruby
<%= signature_text(@method, overload: ov) %>
```
<%- unless ov.tags(:param).empty? -%>

**Params:**

<%- ov.tags(:param).each do |p| -%>
- `<%= p.name %>` (<%= type_ref(p.types && p.types.first) %>) — <%= markdownify(p.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- ov_return = ov.tag(:return) -%>
<%- if ov_return -%>

**Returns:** <%= type_ref(ov_return.types && ov_return.types.first) %> — <%= markdownify(ov_return.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- else -%>
<%- primary = overloads.first -%>
```ruby
<%= signature_text(@method, overload: primary) %>
```

<%- if private_api_annotation(@method) -%>
**<%= private_api_annotation(@method) %>**

<%- end -%>
<%= markdownify(@method.docstring) %>
<%- param_tags = primary ? primary.tags(:param) : @method.tags(:param) -%>
<%- unless param_tags.empty? -%>

**Params:**

<%- param_tags.each do |p| -%>
- `<%= p.name %>` (<%= type_ref(p.types && p.types.first) %>) — <%= markdownify(p.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- yt = yield_tag(@method) -%>
<%- if yt -%>
<%- yt_names = yt.types || [] -%>

**Yields:** <%- unless yt_names.empty? -%><%= yt_names.map { |n| "`#{n}`" }.join(', ') %> — <%- end -%><%= markdownify(yt.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.tags(:yieldparam).empty? -%>

**Yield Params:**

<%- @method.tags(:yieldparam).each do |p| -%>
- `<%= p.name %>` (<%= type_ref(p.types && p.types.first) %>) — <%= markdownify(p.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- yieldreturn_tag = @method.tag(:yieldreturn) -%>
<%- if yieldreturn_tag -%>

**Yield Returns:** <%= type_ref(yieldreturn_tag.types && yieldreturn_tag.types.first) %> — <%= markdownify(yieldreturn_tag.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- if overloads.size < 2 -%>
<%- return_tag = primary ? primary.tag(:return) : method_return_tag(@method) -%>
<%- if return_tag -%>

**Returns:** <%= type_ref(return_tag.types && return_tag.types.first) %> — <%= markdownify(return_tag.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.tags(:raise).empty? -%>

**Raises:**

<%- @method.tags(:raise).each do |r| -%>
- <%= type_ref(r.types && r.types.first) %> — <%= markdownify(r.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.tags(:see).empty? -%>

**See also:** <%= @method.tags(:see).map { |t| see_ref(t) }.join(', ') %>
<%- end -%>

**Defined in:** `<%= @method.file %>:<%= @method.line %>`
